summary: Run an AI-powered Fedora package review

description: |
  Reviews a Koji scratch build against the Fedora Packaging Guidelines using
  the fedora-package-review Claude Code skill, run headlessly through the
  Claude Agent SDK.

# No mock/build tooling involved (unlike fedora-review), so a plain container
# is enough.
provision:
  how: container
  image: fedora:latest

discover:
  how: fmf
  test: /tests/llm-review
